# Environment variables.
# .env is ignored; the committed template is not.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- AI Employee runtime vault -------------------------------------------------
# The vault is runtime state, not source. The watcher, Gmail watcher and task
# planner write captured mail, generated tasks, financial records and approval
# requests here, so any of it can contain real personal data. Only the folder
# skeleton is tracked, via .gitkeep.
#
# Sanitized copies of past captures live in tests/fixtures/vault/ and those ARE
# tracked, because they are the test suite's fixtures.
AI_Employee_Vault/Inbox/*
AI_Employee_Vault/Needs_Action/*
AI_Employee_Vault/Needs_Approval/*
AI_Employee_Vault/Done/*
AI_Employee_Vault/Errors/*
AI_Employee_Vault/Plans/*
AI_Employee_Vault/Reports/*
AI_Employee_Vault/Accounting/*
AI_Employee_Vault/Logs/*
!AI_Employee_Vault/**/.gitkeep

# Legacy vault working directory. Anchored to the repo root so it cannot match
# tests/fixtures/vault/ - an unanchored "vault/" would ignore every vault dir.
/vault/
